  "identifier": "ds2-pc-release-2026",
  "headline": "Death Stranding 2: On the Beach hits PC March 19 with ultrawide and new launch features",
  "description": "PlayStation and Kojima Productions confirmed the PC release date for Death Stranding 2: On the Beach, with pre-purchase live on Steam and Epic Games Store. The PC edition supports ultrawide formats, 4K, mouse and keyboard controls, and DualSense features, alongside new modes and rewards also coming to PS5 at launch.",
  "articleBody": "PlayStation Blog confirmed that Death Stranding 2: On the Beach launches on PC on March 19, 2026, with pre-purchase available now on Steam and the Epic Games Store. The announcement trailer debuted during the latest State of Play presentation, marking the formal start of the PC rollout.\n\nKojima Productions says the PC version is developed in collaboration with Nixxes Software. The sequel returns to Sam’s journey to reconnect Australia to the Chiral network, facing enemies, environmental hazards, and the ever-present Timefall while the Social Strand System links players worldwide.\n\nPC-specific upgrades include 21:9 and 32:9 ultrawide support at 4K, full mouse and keyboard customization, and DualSense controller integration with haptics and adaptive triggers. The studio also confirmed new modes and features arriving at launch for both PC and PS5, with more details expected soon.",
